    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10100" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντι-ληπτέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must take part in</i> a matter: abs., Ar <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				485
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πραγμάτων αὐτοῖς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					1.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>one must hold back,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ ἵππου τῷ χαλινῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					8.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adj.
